OL,3,ABadenoch presses Burnham on benefits
OL,4,Aand Brexit vote claims at PMQs
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeanwhile, Burnham pledges to bring
OL,7,Fdown the benefits bill when asked if he
OL,8,Fis "afraid" of a row with his MPs over
OL,9,Fwelfare
OL,11,FIn the first PMQs since party
OL,12,Fconference season, Burnham also tells
OL,13,FMPs Manchester City did not raise the
OL,14,Fissue of the Premier League financial
OL,15,Fcharges with him or his team
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
